@faction_strength
title: Building the right
subtitle: Build up the party's right wing.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and bartsch_advisor == 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; pragmatist_strength += 1.5*(bartsch_advisor_fame/100); pragmatist_dissent -= 0.7*(bartsch_advisor_fame/100); oldleft_dissent += 0.5; beweli_dissent += 0.5; bartsch_advisor_fame += 2;

We have strengthened the party's right wing, favoring a pragmatist and reform-oriented approach to politics. While our move has found many supporters, our left wing feels under attack.

@moderate_foreign
title: Moderate our foreign policy
subtitle: Push <span style="color: #BC2D72;">Die Linke</span> towards a more friendly view of the West.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and bartsch_advisor == 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; foreign_moderation += 0.6*(bartsch_advisor_fame/100); pragmatist_dissent -= 0.5*(bartsch_advisor_fame/100); greens_relation += 1.5*(bartsch_advisor_fame/100); cdu_relation += 0.7*(bartsch_advisor_fame/100); oldleft_dissent += 1; issue_antimilitarism -= 0.3; bartsch_advisor_fame += 2;

We have slightly moderated our foreign policy, bringing ourselves closer to NATO and the EU. The moderate parties notice and appreciate our move, but our left wing disapproves.

